# Text files are LF everywhere, including Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true:
# CRLF working copies broke tests that parse docs (supabase-report-sql) and made
# every test run rewrite snapshots and catalogs with line-ending-only diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.tflite binary
*.pem -text
